Box 51106 (goal 24190, needs list). The helper asked for a notary and a
photographer was one of the owner's three electricians:

- 4324: his answer matched the electrician row by his number, so that row
  read „უპასუხა" with an answer about rows 3 and 8. A found row whose answer
  names other rows of the list and not itself now keeps „route found" and an
  empty answer cell; the answer stays on the rows it names.
- 4325: work_the_list gave the run one way in per row, so the chat named one
  electrician. A found row now also carries everyoneWhoFits (the same lookup
  the Excel file uses), when more than the one contact fits. Not stored.

